{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1522174-kithain-counterpart-to-lurks","id":1522174,"title":"Kithain counterpart to Lurks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-09-06T12:10:35-07:00","id":1522174,"title":"Kithain counterpart to Lurks","content":"Just as it says in the tin: what would the Kithain counterpart to Lurks be?<br /> <br /> I know there is not a canon Kith for it, but there should be one, right? I mean, if not, I guess I didn't understand the Thalain at all.<br /> <br /> I'm more interested in a flavor and myths/legends point of view, and less on a rules one. Some Thalain seem to be a &quot;corrupted&quot; version of their Kithain counterparts, while others seem like just the opposite. What would work better in this case?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26311-ulbrecht","name":"Ulbrecht","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26311_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T15:23:19-07:00","id":1522185,"title":"","content":"There is a Kithain called Boraro that is typical of South America, a way of saying that he is fanmade, that he is a protector of nature and people, which in theory is the opposite of what Lurk does. Here's a page I found on Wikia, I hope it's useful:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Boraro\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Boraro</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T17:05:56-07:00","id":1522189,"title":"","content":"The lurks are pretty nice for a Thallain, so maybe some sort of teddy bear kith?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T06:12:25-07:00","id":1522212,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1522174-kithain-counterpart-to-lurks?p=1522185#post1522185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a Kithain called Boraro that is typical of South America, a way of saying that he is fanmade, that he is a protector of nature and people, which in theory is the opposite of what Lurk does. Here's a page I found on Wikia, I hope it's useful:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Boraro\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Boraro</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Not quite what I imagined, but I guess it works...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26311-ulbrecht","name":"Ulbrecht","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26311_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T06:13:04-07:00","id":1522213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zenten</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1522174-kithain-counterpart-to-lurks?p=1522189#post1522189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The lurks are pretty nice for a Thallain, so maybe some sort of teddy bear kith?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I have to ask: how would that teddy bear kith be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26311-ulbrecht","name":"Ulbrecht","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26311_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T03:11:23-07:00","id":1522338,"title":"","content":"Beats me. It would make for a great Lycian; but a Kith? I don't see it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T10:15:50-07:00","id":1522345,"title":"","content":"A teddy bear is more like a chimera. What is a Lycian?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T14:18:10-07:00","id":1522360,"title":"","content":"A Lycian is a new character type introduced in the Player's Guide. It's a kind of chimera that has a physical form: a teddy bear Lycian would have a physical form that actually would <i>be </i>a teddy bear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}